These are its achievements, and also its evidence of guilt—
 Someone fell to the ground, scratching at themselves, tearing off skin and flesh, exposing ghastly white bone; 
 Someone clutched their head, their eyes losing focus, their breathing growing weaker and weaker; 
 Someone vomited incessantly, until finally, they died in convulsions; 
 Someone suddenly laughed, laughing until they couldn't catch their breath; 
 Someone, in the midst of a fierce battle with an opponent, suddenly stopped, both of them looking at each other... 
 Then, they embraced and kissed.
